8. Realm Architecture
The platform consists of two isolated realms.

Teen Realm
Adult Realm
Realm Isolation
Cross-realm interaction is prohibited.

The following are blocked:

Messaging
Voice Chat
Friend Requests
Trading
Gifting
Marketplace Access
Community Membership
Realm Validation
Example:

User Realm = TEEN
Room Realm = ADULT

Result = Access Denied
All validation occurs server-side.

