Conclusion
The Virtual World Platform architecture is designed around four foundational pillars:

Identity Continuity
Realm Separation
Trust & Safety
Scalable Social Interaction
The system allows users to grow with their accounts over time while ensuring that age-appropriate environments remain isolated, secure, and manageable as the platform expands from a small prototype to a large-scale persistent virtual world.
